==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_66.svg|32px]] '''Silk CubicSurface_66''' command creates a CubicSurface_66 from a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid66|ControlGrid66]].

