==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid66|ControlGrid66]]
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_66.svg|16px]] CubicSurface_66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_66.svg|16px]] CubicSurface_66}} option from the menu.
# A '''CubicSurface_66''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''CubicSurface_66''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|C1 - Inputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Grid|Link}}: Control Grid.
* {{PropertyData|reverse|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Reverses the surface normal direction.

{{Properties_Title|C3 - Identifiers}}

* {{PropertyData|internalName|String}}: The permanent internal FreeCAD name for this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_type|String}}: Default is {{value|CubicSurface_66}}. The workbench class used to create this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_version|String}}: The class version of this object.


